OL,3,GNEWSABernard Matthews confirms closure
OL,4,Aof city factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British food giant is set to close
OL,7,Fits factory in Derby amid "significant
OL,8,Ffinancial losses".
OL,10,FBernard Matthews Foods has confirmed it
OL,11,Fwill be shutting its processing
OL,12,Ffacility on Shaftesbury Street South by
OL,13,Fthe end of 2026.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the company said the
OL,16,Fdecision had been made at the
OL,17,Fconclusion of consultations with
OL,18,F"employee and union representatives".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
