OL,3,GNEWSABernard Matthews confirms closure
OL,4,Aof city factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision comes two years after the
OL,7,Fcompany announced plans to close a
OL,8,Fplant at its headquarters in Great
OL,9,FWitchingham, Norfolk, where its
OL,10,Ffounder built his empire.
